[{"client_msg_id":"b5ae6f01-bc0b-434e-893c-f01bcce64148","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"\u003chttps://github.com/codota/TabNine/issues/432|https://github.com/codota/TabNine/issues/432\u003e","ts":"1635405931.103400","attachments":[{"color":"36a64f","fallback":"2492x1554px image","id":1,"title":"\u003chttps://github.com/codota/TabNine/issues/432|#432 Inline completions - user feedback \u003e","text":"Hi All, we just released an experimental \"inline Completions\" feature :tada:\n\nPlease share your experience with this feature:pray:\n\nIn order to enable it:\n\n• make sure you are using the latest engine(3.5.37) and extension(3.4.21) version.\n• open the Tabnine Home(from the status bar item), scroll to \"General Preferences\" and check the \"inline Completions\" option\n• restart vscode\n\n\u003chttps://user-images.githubusercontent.com/60742964/128625904-da021af1-dbd9-48f8-907e-d2713486ea36.png|Screen Shot 2021-08-08 at 11 15 14\u003e","image_url":"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/60742964/128625904-da021af1-dbd9-48f8-907e-d2713486ea36.png","fields":[{"title":"Comments","value":"48","short":true}],"mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"\u003chttps://github.com/codota/TabNine|codota/TabNine\u003e","footer_icon":"https://slack.github.com/static/img/favicon-neutral.png","ts":1628107897}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ftes6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"263d2271-77db-4237-ba4b-4d87fa6aeed6","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"こちらも通常の補完とは別の機能になってたはず","ts":"1635405869.103200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"i/vR"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bbe8984b-4dcf-4703-9455-e4eaa36f002e","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"ちなみに、TabNineでも似たような機能はテストしてますね","ts":"1635405857.102700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"axkKi"}]},{"client_msg_id":"775ff0ea-8da0-4f6a-9d82-4ad509cd9375","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"作らなかったって事は何か理由があるのかと。","ts":"1635405786.102100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"olBd9"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a25ee7ab-1310-4360-abb4-d177dfe0c8d3","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"とある LS で現在はスニペットとして出してるがインラインコンプリーションに切り替えようか悩んでるみたいな issue はみたことあります","ts":"1635405784.102000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"NCpL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9ec1f586-7cc4-4db2-a725-b702ffb8dd48","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"copilot-language-server、MS なら自分で作れたと思うんですよね。","ts":"1635405775.101600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"H4J"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7827f7a4-b2d9-4347-8a4d-f9e949ad9500","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"そもそも複数行の表示というのが現在の補完ポップアップと相性が悪い。無理矢理表示させようとすると場所をとる","ts":"1635405640.101200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"kCpaQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"eedb7a25-075c-45ac-8104-ac6ffc7d026c","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"これのことですか？ \u003chttps://github.com/microsoft/vscode-extension-samples/tree/main/inline-completions\u003e","ts":"1635405631.100800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bcB1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"aa279ba6-a3bf-4a4a-aecf-72245d0893fb","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"イマイチ、双方の兼ね合いもわかってないんですよね。予想としては InlineSuggest があれば Suggest は出さない。とかなのかなあとは思っていたりするんですが。","ts":"1635405536.099500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ijLYa"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f35b3378-f424-4b9e-8fba-cc4ea9e00ae3","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"あれ、VSCode 内では「InlineSuggest」or「GhostText」と呼ばれているみたいで、「Suggest」とは別機能って扱いになってるんですよね。","ts":"1635405506.098900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=9H"}]},{"client_msg_id":"60e3a296-3c52-4054-bc5c-ebc663fcc92f","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"別の方がよいか補完と統合するべきか議論がありそうである","ts":"1635405464.098000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"p9z"}]},{"client_msg_id":"82665162-dc44-4eed-a490-dd241c69db30","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"copilot-language-server  があれば、現時点で対応してないエディタ/IDE(クライアント)も対応しやすいですしね","ts":"1635405427.096800","edited":{"user":"U7TMPGWJ0","ts":"1635405448.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"H7w"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1A68BF64-BE9F-45AF-906A-677A3E212A32","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"completionの複数行展開を通常の補完に入れたい","ts":"1635405366.096200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"H466"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c87321b1-8a67-4227-9f50-1ee95b87daec","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"copilot-language-server みたいなの普通に作れそう。。。","ts":"1635404960.095600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"kZAW"}]}]
